WEBVTT

00:00:00.853 --> 00:00:02.314
The wind eased.

00:00:02.314 --> 00:00:04.714
Under shortened sail,
Flying Scud carried

00:00:04.714 --> 00:00:07.164
Captain Cross and Musgrave
up the harbour.

00:00:07.164 --> 00:00:08.951
The house appeared a mile ahead.

00:00:10.732 --> 00:00:12.984
One man ran indoors for the other.

00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:15.059
Cross and Musgrave landed.

00:00:15.059 --> 00:00:16.634
The cutter stayed under sail.

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:18.132
It was too rough to anchor.

